      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dragon magnifies the hope of another creature it can see within 60 feet of itself. Whenever damage would reduce the creature to 0 Hit Points, it makes a Charisma saving throw (DC 15 or equal to the damage taken, whichever is higher). On a successful save, the creature is reduced to 1 Hit Point instead. This benefit lasts for 1 hour, until the dragon or target becomes Incapacitated, or until the dragon takes this Bonus Action again.</p>",
